<title>USA: Prentiss Properties buys building near Denver.</title>
<headline>Prentiss Properties buys building near Denver.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prentiss Properties Trust said Tuesday it had acquired a 198,000-square-foot office building outside Denver for $21.1 million.</p>
<p>Prentiss said it is the first property acquired in this market, where the company already has an established property management and leasing operation.</p>
<p>The acquisition, known as the FHP Building, in Englewood, Colo., is located on a 5.7-acre site about 21 minutes from central Denver.</p>
